>\\n                <div class=\\"hk-soal-action-row\\">\\n                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"hk-btn hk-btn-primary hk-btn-sm\\" id=\\"btn-check-8\\" onclick=\\"checkArticleAnswer(8)\\" disabled>Periksa Jawaban</button>\\n                    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"hk-btn hk-soal-toggle-btn\\\" id=\\\"btn-toggle-8\\\" onclick=\\\"toggleSoalExplanation(\'exp-8\')\\\">\\n                <svg width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"></circle><polyline points=\\\"12 16 12 12 12 8\\\"></polyline></svg>\\n                <span>Kunci &amp; Pembahasan</span>\\n            </button>\\n                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"hk-btn hk-btn-subtle hk-btn-sm\\" onclick=\\"resetArticleAnswer(8)\\"><svg width=\\"13\\" height=\\"13\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"2.5\\"><path d=\\"M21.5 2v6h-6M21.34 15.57a10 10 0 1 1-.57-8.38l5.67-5.67\\"></path></svg><span>Ulangi Soal</span></button>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"hk-soal-explanation is-hidden\\" id=\\"exp-8\\">\\n                    <span class=\\"hk-soal-kunci-badge\\">Kunci Jawaban Resmi: B</span>\\n                    <div style=\\"margin-top: 6px; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.65;\\"><strong>Pembahasan:</strong> Insan BUMN dituntut senantiasa haus meningkatkan kapasitas kompetensi diri guna menjawab tantangan persaingan global yang dinamis. Pilihan B mencerminkan komitmen keunggulan (*strive for excellence*).</div>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <!-- Soal 9: Harmonis -->\\n            <div class=\\"hk-interactive-soal\\" id=\\"soal-box-9\\" data-soal-num=\\"9\\" data-key=\\"B\\">\\n                <div class=\\"hk-soal-header\\">\\n                    <div style=\\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-number-badge\\">Soal AKHLAK #9</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-category-tag\\">Pilar Nilai: HARMONIS &amp; EMPATI</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <span class=\\"hk-soal-status-badge\\" id=\\"soal-status-9\\" style=\\"display:none; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;\\"></span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"hk-soal-text\\">Seorang rekan kerja satu meja Anda mengalami penurunan kinerja drastis selama beberapa hari terakhir karena anggota keluarganya sedang sakit kritis di rumah sakit. Tenggat waktu laporan tim semakin dekat. Tindakan terbaik Anda adalah...</div>\\n                <div class=\\"hk-soal-options-group\\" id=\\"options-group-9\\">\\n                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"hk-soal-opt-btn\\" id=\\"opt-btn-9-A\\" data-letter=\\"A\\" onclick=\\"selectArticleAnswer(9, \'A\')\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-badge\\">A</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-label\\">Melaporkan ketidakefektifan kerjanya kepada HRD agar rekan tersebut segera diberi sanksi surat peringatan.</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"hk-soal-opt-btn\\" id=\\"opt-btn-9-B\\" data-letter=\\"B\\" onclick=\\"selectArticleAnswer(9, \'B\')\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-badge\\">B</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-label\\">Menunjukkan empati, menanyakan kabar secara personal, dan berkoordinasi dengan tim untuk membagi porsi tugasnya secara adil agar target laporan tetap selesai tepat waktu.</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"hk-soal-opt-btn\\" id=\\"opt-btn-9-C\\" data-letter=\\"C\\" onclick=\\"selectArticleAnswer(9, \'C\')\\">\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-badge\\">C</span>\\n                        <span class=\\"hk-soal-opt-label\\">Meng